    <content>
      <![CDATA[<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no"?>
<!DOCTYPE en-note SYSTEM "http://xml.evernote.com/pub/enml2.dtd">
<en-note><table style="border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px"><b>date</b></td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px"><b>route</b></td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px"><b>time</b></td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px"><b>dist</b></td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px"><b>avg HR</b></td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px"><b>notes</b></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">Aug 16</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">Embarcadero -&gt; Crissy Field out/back</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">1:35</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">11.9 mi</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">149</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">foggy, perfect</td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">Aug 23</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">Golden Gate Park loop + Ocean Beach</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">1:42</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">12.8 mi</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">152</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">last 20' @ 6:44 avg</td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">Aug 30</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">down week: GGP</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">1:25</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">10.6 mi</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">147</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px"></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">Sep 6</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">Embarcadero -&gt; Fort Mason -&gt; Crissy</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">1:50</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">14.0 mi</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">151</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px"></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">Sep 13</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">(rehearsal instead) 10 mi @ goal</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">1:04:38</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">10.0 mi</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">171</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">6:28 avg, race shoes. hard but controlled</td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">Sep 20</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">GGP + Great Highway</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">1:52</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">14.3 mi</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">153</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">6 mi @ 6:36 in the middle</td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">Sep 27</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">Crissy + bridge out and back</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">1:41</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">12.9 mi</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">154</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">windy on the bridge, HR up</td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">Oct 4</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">GGP easy</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">1:20</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">10.3 mi</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">148</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">with Sam for the first 5</td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">Oct 11</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">Embarcadero easy</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">0:55</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">7.4 mi</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">146</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">taper. legs bouncy</td></tr></table><div><br/></div><div>Rehearsal 9/13 is the confidence one: 6:28 for 10 miles at 171 means 1:25 is realistic if the course is as flat as advertised.</div></en-note>]]>
